# Carbon — Implemented vs Specified
**Status:** v1 — provisional implementation ledger for team review

Current design specs supersede the historical Grok-era framework. This ledger never infers implementation from specification. Implementation assessments below are preliminary and should be tightened ticket-by-ticket during Build Out.

## Status vocabulary
**SPECIFIED** = normative behavior exists.  
**IMPLEMENTED** = code materially implements it.  
**TESTED** = acceptance/invariant tests demonstrate it in the intended environment.  
**PRODUCTION-QUALIFIED** = required human scientific/security/operational qualification is complete.

